COMMENT was checked against the four clients' own bytes, and only it carries an established meaning; the others are named
COMMENT by their field index, their types and widths the hypotheses' (never read). An MH2O instance's second word of 43
COMMENT or more is a LiquidObject ID, copy rows included (docs/world-viewer/09-liquids.md 1.2). Its hash is the same in
COMMENT Retail 12.1.5, Classic Era 1.15.9, MoP Classic 5.5.4 and Classic Beta 1.60.1. A layout not listed here is not read.

